<title>FRANCE: France outlines bids for EU free-mkt wheat, barley.</title>
<headline>France outlines bids for EU free-mkt wheat, barley.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>European grain exporters made the following free-market bids through France at this week's EU tender, French cereals office (ONIC) said. All bids are for refunds and are in Ecus/tonne.</p>
<p>		     --- Sept 26---		 --- Sept 19---</p>
<p>		 Tonnage  Range of Bids     Tonnage  Range of Bids</p>
<p>MAIN TENDER</p>
<p> Soft wheat  657,750    4.47-12.99	379,250    0.74-13.97</p>
<p> Barley	496,000   29.77-38.47	 94,000   24.92-29.87</p>
<p> Rye	     6,000    Not given	 None</p>
<p>ACP TENDER</p>
<p> Soft wheat    4,500    Not given	 15,000    7.20-9.97</p>
</text>
